  "_comment_overrides": "rpc-websockets v9 is ESM-only. @solana/web3.js pulls it in, and Vercel's serverless Node runtime require()s it — which crashes api/battle.js's verify-mint action with 'require() of ES Module .../rpc-websockets/...'. 7.11.0 is the last CommonJS release and is what the Solana community pins to for this exact failure. Nothing in this app uses websocket subscriptions, so the older client costs us nothing.",
